<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="33418857"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536130473"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="LAST STARDUST"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Aimer"/><amll:meta key="album" value="DAWN"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:18.667"><div begin="00:25.946" end="04:51.621"><p begin="00:25.946" end="00:32.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">ふりしきる強い雨 描いた理想(ゆめ)の果て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狂风骤雨无休止飘落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri shi ki ru tsu yo i a me</span></p><p begin="00:32.138" end="00:37.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">震える肩濡らし 歩き続けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">行至心中理想的尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru ka ta nu ra shi a ru ki tsu zu ke ta</span></p><p begin="00:37.750" end="00:43.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">擦り切れた小さな手 隙間を埋めるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">擦破的稚嫩小手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ri ki re ta chi i sa na te</span></p><p begin="00:43.901" end="00:49.606" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">色の消えた記憶 拾い集めた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至掩埋空缺的缝隙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro no ki e ta ki o ku hi ro i a tsu me ta</span></p><p begin="00:50.017" end="01:01.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">愛しさ 優しさ すべて投げ出してもいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眷恋 柔情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i to shi sa ya sa shi sa</span></p><p begin="01:01.275" end="01:10.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">失くしたもの 見つけたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要找回丢失之物就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ku shi ta mo no mi tsu ke ta na ra</span></p><p begin="01:10.075" end="01:21.929" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">傷つくのが運命(さだめ)だとしても 心はまだ彩(いろ)を放つ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕命中注定遍体鳞伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ku no ga sa da me da to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="01:21.939" end="01:33.524" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">最後のStardust 舞いあがれ Dust to dust, ash to ash 彼方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后的星尘飘扬高空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go no stardust ma i a ga re</span></p><p begin="01:33.534" end="01:40.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">願いの破片よ 届け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心愿的碎片啊 传递吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga i no ha he n yo to do ke</span></p><p begin="01:48.540" end="01:54.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">遠ざかる通り雨 消えてく夜の風<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">骤雨渐行渐远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o za ka ru to o ri a me</span></p><p begin="01:54.697" end="02:00.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">孤独だけが 傍にたたずんでいた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有孤独 仍驻足在旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do ku da ke ga so ba ni ta ta zu n de i ta</span></p><p begin="02:00.805" end="02:11.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">選んだ 正しさ すべて間違いでもいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自身选择的正义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e ra n da ta da shi sa</span></p><p begin="02:12.073" end="02:20.868" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">信じたもの 守れたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要守住心中信念就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji ta mo no ma mo re ta na ra</span></p><p begin="02:20.878" end="02:32.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">傷だらけの硝子の心が 忘れかけた熱を灯す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伤痕累累的玻璃之心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu da ra ke no ga ra su no ko ko ro ga</span></p><p begin="02:32.771" end="02:43.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">最後のStardust 舞いあがれ Dust to dust, earth to earth 彼方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后的星尘飘扬高空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go no Stardust ma i a ga re</span></p><p begin="02:44.352" end="02:53.197" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">願いの破片よ 永遠(とわ)へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心愿的碎片啊 请去往永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga i no ha he n yo to wa he</span></p><p begin="03:55.372" end="04:07.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">傷つくのが運命(さだめ)だとしても 心はまだ彩(いろ)を放つ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕命中注定遍体鳞伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu ku no ga sa da me da to shi te mo</span></p><p begin="04:07.152" end="04:18.385" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">さよなら Judas 灰になれ Dust to dust いつかの弱さへ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别了 Judas 化为灰烬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra Judas ha i ni na re</span></p><p begin="04:18.903" end="04:30.729" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">傷だらけの硝子の心が 忘れかけた熱を灯す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伤痕累累的玻璃之心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu da ra ke no ga ra su no ko ko ro ga</span></p><p begin="04:30.744" end="04:42.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">最後のStardust 舞いあがれ Dust to dust, ash to ash 彼方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后的星尘飘扬高空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa i go no stardust ma i a ga re</span></p><p begin="04:42.412" end="04:51.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">願いの破片よ 永遠(とわ)へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心愿的碎片啊 请去往永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga i no ha he n yo to wa he</span></p></div></body></tt>